3x-7y=5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form." 13194139534207 17592186045417 true] [17592186414018 1072 #uuid "13eff08d-2b22-5094-8876-818462babb6f" 13194139534207 17592186045417 true] [17592186414018 1074 "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -8 & 10 \\\\ 3 & -7 & 5\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}2 & -8 & 10 \\\\ 3 & -7 & 5\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & 5 \\\\ 3 & -7 & 5\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 5 & -10\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :=\\frac{1}{5}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534207 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-29b00cee-94fc-5ef4-95de-2345a02742de" 17592186414012 "answer-35507ba3-dc5e-5f36-bb3c-2cadb07fb8ff" 17592186414013 "answer-632206dd-bb16-5704-9288-1e7bf08e0cfc" 17592186414014 "answer-7bad20ef-df3c-52d4-a10d-b7e2a38262ad" 17592186414015 "answer-92cfbdd1-6bb8-5b06-89f2-6d7a9c5e7075" 17592186414016 "answer-field-cae93ed5-7aca-5036-ae81-d4a677001210" 17592186414017 "question-13eff08d-2b22-5094-8876-818462babb6f" 17592186414018} :edb/committed false :edb/speculative true}
